### Phoenix Static Resources ###
# 通用规则：所有静态资源目录
**/src/main/resources/static/

# 旧路径保护：防止误提交 phoenix-server 下的静态文件
phoenix-backend/phoenix-server/phoenix-server-start/src/main/resources/static/
phoenix-backend/phoenix-server/phoenix-server-biz/src/main/resources/static/
phoenix-backend/phoenix-server/phoenix-server-common/src/main/resources/static/

# 新路径保护：phoenix-runtime 下的静态文件  
phoenix-backend/phoenix-runtime/phoenix-runtime-start/src/main/resources/static/
phoenix-backend/phoenix-runtime/phoenix-runtime-biz/src/main/resources/static/
phoenix-backend/phoenix-runtime/phoenix-runtime-common/src/main/resources/static/

